    "<p>This dataset shows the boundaries of the Silt Bluff Development Permit area within the City of Kamloops.  Within these areas a development permit is required prior to the commencement of:</p><ul><li>subdivision of land</li><li>alteration of land or removal, alteration, disruption, or destruction of vegetation or disturbance of soils</li></ul><p>Further details can be found in the Silt Bluffs Hazard Zone Development Permit Guidelines here:  <a href='https://kamloops.civicweb.net/document/81121'>https://kamloops.civicweb.net/document/81121</a></p>"
